session lifecycle, stale-process reclamation, and profile isolation management; the real-time
step-streaming and IPC bridge protocols; the standardized error classification taxonomy
(`ERR-*` codes); the bring-your-own-key provider routing and Keychain-encrypted credential
architecture; the local service authentication and sandboxing architecture; provider
rate-limit pacing logic; the hardened local-file access guard; the prompt composition and
interception pipeline; and any model routing, retry, or scheduling heuristics derived from the
foregoing.

1.5. **"Derivative Work"** means any work of authorship, modification, patch, fork, extension,
translation, or port (including translating or porting the Software or the non-literal
