4.4. **No SDK, Library, or OEM Embedding:** Extract, link, wrap, bundle, or embed the Software,
its bundled backend binary, or the Agent Orchestration Architecture into any third-party
application, automation suite, agent framework, or hardware device.

4.5. **Contractual Covenant Against Reverse Engineering, Extraction, Non-Literal Porting, and
Circumvention:** As an express contractual condition of using the Software, You covenant and
agree that You will not, directly or through any third party: (a) reverse-engineer, decompile,
disassemble, decrypt, or otherwise attempt to derive the source code, object code, or underlying
structure of the Software or any portion thereof (including the bundled backend binary), except
